      "mentions": 30,
      "title": {
        "en": "Expansive koi displays and aquarium setups"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers consistently praise the extensive facility for its vast inventory of pond accessories, live plants, aquarium setups, and diverse freshwater fish. While two visitors voiced frustration over cluttered aisles or tank cleanliness, most customers enjoy exploring the unique variety of aquatic supplies."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 31,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful owner advice with service variations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients commend Patrick and the customer service team for taking time to guide beginners on pond setups, tank compatibility, and specialized diets. In contrast, a few reviewers report uneven interactions with specific counter associates, noting occasional pricing confusion or blunt communication."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 32,
      "title": {
        "en": "Diverse species selection and wellness concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers appreciate the wide assortment of companion species available, from Japanese koi and exotic reptiles to healthy birds and feeder mice. However, several dissatisfied patrons expressed concern regarding animal longevity, citing isolated losses of young birds or delicate aquatic specimens shortly after purchase."
      }
    }
  ],
